+The vendor tile draws the vendor's black-and-white mark: the preset vendor's family mark (Claude, OpenAI, Gemini, Kimi, Qwen, Zhipu, MiniMax, DeepSeek, or Grok), else the first family name found in the model id or name, such as Llama, Mistral, Doubao, Hunyuan, ERNIE, or StepFun. A model that matches nothing shows the first letter of its name. The marks come from Lobe Icons under MIT; see [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
