+Browse local subagent conversations and external tasks from the parent header. Local conversations show activity, token usage, and duration; continuable children accept follow-up prompts and support Stop. External tasks appear as non-navigable leaves without an execution status. Historical one-shot conversations open as read-only records. The ordinary sidebar omits subagent conversations, and the separate `@` source inserts a running child's label without granting continuation authority. The Agents view shows the current Session's whole agent family as a live tree, with status, model, token total, and active time on every card.
 
